<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Earbud controls (gesture config): a raised index finger with touch ripples either side of its tip.

  24dp viewport, one white stroke colour, tinted per theme in code (ThemeRes.tint).
  Do NOT bake a colour in: on the light theme a baked white glyph is invisible.
-->
